 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Dark Claw — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>Finally at 18th level, you have learned to expand your domain. At initiative 20, you stab your claws through space targeting a creature within your domain with a guaranteed hit with your claws while ignoring distance and dealing critical damage (cannot roll for Black Flash). All of your Claw attacks are guaranteed hits within your domain and you can swap any number of your Claw options at the beginning of your turn.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
